## 🚀 Quick Start

### 1. Install & Setup (5 minutes)
```bash
npm install
cd frontend && npm install && cd ..
cd backend && npm install && cd ..
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env with your credentials
```

### 2. Start Development
```bash
npm run dev:all
# Frontend: http://localhost:5173
# Backend: http://localhost:3000
```

### 3. Build & Deploy
```bash
build-web.bat --all
./scripts/deploy.sh production
```

